# automatic-refinement

Apply the automatic-refinement skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- plan and execute a mandatory six-role refinement graph
- route dynamic domain skills through the canonical skill graph
- enforce typed handoffs, budgets, convergence, and independent verification
- synthesize a review-ready RefinementArtifact without remote effects

Stop when: All mandatory roles have valid handoffs, synthesis is independently verified, and a RefinementArtifact is emitted at refined-awaiting-review or a typed terminal failure is returned.
